                                                                    <p>Not much. The more prepared you are, the faster we move — but we&#8217;re used to starting from scratch. Helpful to have: brand guidelines or logo files, reference videos you admire,
                                                                        a rough idea of the message you want to communicate, and your timeline. We&#8217;ll help you clarify everything else in the kick-off call.</p>
                                                                </div>
