                                                                <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-c3f35f8 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="c3f35f8" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
                                                                    <p>Every project is scoped individually based on complexity, length, and type of animation. A short explainer video typically starts at $3,500. A full 3D product launch film starts at $12,000.
                                                                        Brand motion systems are quoted separately. We don&#8217;t publish fixed prices because the variables matter — but we&#8217;re always transparent and provide a detailed quote before
                                                                        any work begins.</p>
                                                                </div>
