                                                                <div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bd24b4b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="bd24b4b" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
                                                                    <p>We work on a 50/50 payment structure for most projects: 50% upfront to begin, and 50% upon final delivery. For larger productions over $20,000, we offer a 40/30/30 milestone-based structure.
                                                                        All payments are invoiced and can be made via bank transfer or credit card. We work in USD, EUR, and GBP.</p>
                                                                </div>
