                                                                    <p>Yes — clients who commit to ongoing retainer arrangements or multi-project packages receive preferential rates. We value long-term creative partnerships and reflect that in how we price
                                                                        them. If you have multiple projects in mind or anticipate ongoing motion needs, mention it upfront and we&#8217;ll structure a proposal that works for both sides.</p>
