                                                                    <p>Yes, every project starts with a signed contract. It covers: scope of work, timeline, payment schedule, revision policy, ownership of final assets, and confidentiality. Full intellectual
                                                                        property ownership transfers to you upon final payment. We also offer NDA agreements for clients who require them — just request it before kick-off.</p>
