                                                                    <p>A standard explainer video (60–90 seconds) takes 3–4 weeks from kick-off to delivery. A full 3D production or brand film takes 6–10 weeks depending on complexity. Rush projects are possible
                                                                        with a 25% expedite fee, subject to availability. We always agree on the timeline before signing, and we hold to it.</p>
